    "commit_body": "Phase 3d parsimony ablation on the Verification Substrate: the post-pre_boost score-stage tail is net-dilutive on the funded Apex book. Per-member apex-EV attribution (30dte_apex payoff): cont-echo + EARN_BOOST = neutral-EV supply that hurts via over-deployment DD; daily-volume = negative-EV adds; WVD = dampens out the highest-EV signals. Whole-tail ablation MC N=300x8: lean 5y +1,143%/51.3%DD vs full +1,097%/62.1%DD, collapse=0. EARN_BOOST's apparent +7% apex-EV was N=77 sample noise (regressed to +0.2pp at N=179; matches v70 honest-recal 'thin/hygiene-not-alpha'). Keeps lean core (components+weekly+regime+ext-focal+CWWD/CSWC). Reversible via /revert. Evidence: experiments/skill_vs_baseline/OVERNIGHT_FINDINGS.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
